[[File:Crystalline Oasis.png|thumb|300px|Crystalline Oasis]]
The '''Crystalline Oasis''' is an oasis located in the southeastern regions of the [[Badlands]]. The only water to be found in the Badlands, it is guarded by a shimmering magical crystal, and with it, the [[Blue dragonflight]] that is surveying its properties.<ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/20260514170802/https://turtlecraft.gg/new-locations-and-maps New Zones & World Edits]. Archived from [https://turtlecraft.gg/new-locations-and-maps the original] on 2026-05-14. Retrieved on 2026-29-08.</ref>

